  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The development, by reason of the excessive number of &lt;/span&gt;bedrooms and occupants on this site, poor levels of outlook from habitable rooms&amp;nbsp;and the lack of adequate communal living space to service the needs of the future occupiers&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt; would provide substandard living accommodation for existing/ future occupiers of the site, and impact on the amenity of &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;neighbouring&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;lubbz0eu1jtb78hmr&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;neighbouring&lt;/span&gt; properties due to over-intensification of the site to the detriment of their living conditions. The development is thereby contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D3.D(7), (9) and (10) of The London Plan (2021), Policies DM1 A, DM1 C, DM1 D (f), (g), (h), (i) and DM30 A (b) and (c) of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
